this is really about when a leader reveals

1363
02:06:57,955 --> 02:06:58,996
it to the world.

1364
02:07:01,687 --> 02:07:07,716
Here is the keystone. It is an idea, not a
document or a secret, and in a sense it’s

1365
02:07:07,756 --> 02:07:13,714
already here. In this film I lay out how I
reasoned my way to it: what I looked at,

1366
02:07:13,754 --> 02:07:17,327
what I ruled out, and what would count
against it.

1367
02:07:20,017 --> 02:07:25,979
In 1796, George Washington used his
Farewell Address to warn us about “the

1368
02:07:26,019 --> 02:07:31,657
spirit of party.” He wasn’t taking a side.
He was warning about sides.

1369
02:07:34,347 --> 02:07:39,634
The Quran says humanity was made into
nations and tribes so that we may know one

1370
02:07:39,674 --> 02:07:45,027
another. Different tradition, same hope:
that we learn to live and work alongside

1371
02:07:45,067 --> 02:07:45,826
each other.

1372
02:07:49,417 --> 02:07:55,780
What comes after a test? Tests end. I
think this one is near its end. But it

1373
02:07:55,820 --> 02:07:57,297
seems fair to ask.

1374
02:08:01,087 --> 02:08:07,634
To be seen in full. I believe that each of
us is held to the light. Every moment,

1375
02:08:07,674 --> 02:08:14,140
shown: the best of us and the worst. The
kindness nobody saw. The thing we would

1376
02:08:14,180 --> 02:08:20,647
take back. I believe it is not to punish
us. It is so we understand who we were.

1377
02:08:23,337 --> 02:08:28,817
And still, nobody is written off. Our
weakest moments are part of the picture.

1378
02:08:28,857 --> 02:08:34,478
They are not the whole picture. Everyone
who has done wrong has also done right,

1379
02:08:34,518 --> 02:08:39,857
and that is still true. I believe we are
seen completely, and still welcome.

1380
02:08:42,547 --> 02:08:49,769
Is there a next level? Maybe this is one
of many. Maybe it is the only one. But it

1381
02:08:49,809 --> 02:08:52,427
is worth asking: what happens?

1382
02:08:55,117 --> 02:09:00,446
Nothing earned remains. So follow the
logic to the end. If care fails, and

1383
02:09:00,486 --> 02:09:06,469
justice cannot replace it, because justice
cannot see perfectly, then what is left?

1384
02:09:06,509 --> 02:09:11,477
Nothing we earned. Nothing we deserve. No
ledger that comes out even.

1385
02:09:14,167 --> 02:09:20,371
Grace. There is exactly one answer that
holds up under all of it. Grace. Not

1386
02:09:20,411 --> 02:09:27,026
earned. Not deserved. Given anyway. It is
the same test, the same verdict, and it

1387
02:09:27,066 --> 02:09:29,327
calls for the same response.

1388
02:09:32,017 --> 02:09:37,367
Give what you were given. We were handed
care we did not earn. We watched justice

1389
02:09:37,407 --> 02:09:42,757
fail us for reasons that were our own. And
the only coherent move left is the one

1390
02:09:42,797 --> 02:09:47,881
that was always on offer: give what you
were given. Hold the door. Return the

1391
02:09:47,921 --> 02:09:53,338
wallet. Put your weapon down first. Say
the true thing when the room is saying the

1392
02:09:53,378 --> 02:09:54,136
false one.

1393
02:09:59,827 --> 02:10:04,811
Treat each other like humans. If I held a
sign on a street corner, this is what it

1394
02:10:04,851 --> 02:10:05,547
would say.

1395
02:10:08,237 --> 02:10:11,237
We’re all in the case. We always were.

1396
02:10:13,927 --> 02:10:17,967
There is still time. There is no deadline
on kindness.

1397
02:10:20,657 --> 02:10:25,979
Things you can do today. Acts of grace are
everywhere. Hold the door. Pay for a

1398
02:10:26,019 --> 02:10:31,273
stranger’s coffee. Give up your seat. Let
the other car merge. Return the lost

1399
02:10:31,313 --> 02:10:36,840
wallet. Sit with someone who is grieving.
Do one that nobody will ever hear about,

1400
02:10:36,880 --> 02:10:42,406
and nothing comes back. If it feels good,
that’s fine. The question is whether you

1401
02:10:42,446 --> 02:10:47,497
would do it anyway. If you are grieving,
you do not owe anyone any of this.

1402
02:10:50,187 --> 02:10:56,337
Grace costs something. The bumper sticker
says coexist. Coexist asks for tolerance,

1403
02:10:56,377 --> 02:11:02,453
and tolerance is passive: you put up with
someone. Grace costs something. You hand

1404
02:11:02,493 --> 02:11:08,495
the wallet back, open the door, put the
weapon down first. Grace is the measuring

1405
02:11:08,535 --> 02:11:09,987
rod of the universe.

1406
02:11:13,577 --> 02:11:19,681
Whatever comes. I know what we can do now:
hold the door, return the wallet, call

1407
02:11:19,721 --> 02:11:25,901
someone who is hurting, or, if you are the
one hurting, call a crisis line: 988 in

1408
02:11:25,941 --> 02:11:31,969
the US, 116 123 in the UK and Ireland,
9-8-8 in Canada, or findahelpline.com for

1409
02:11:32,009 --> 02:11:38,417
your country. Whatever comes after this, I
would like us to meet it having been kind.

1410
02:11:42,207 --> 02:11:47,646
Treat each other like humans. Two things
you can do. One: do one act of grace this

1411
02:11:47,686 --> 02:11:52,124
week. Two: send the cheat sheet to
someone. None of it is required.

1412
02:11:52,164 --> 02:11:56,267
Everything is free at
thisisdisclosure.com, with every source,

1413
02:11:56,307 --> 02:12:01,813
the FAQs and the dated prediction, so you
can check all of it yourself. The QR code

1414
02:12:01,853 --> 02:12:04,487
in the credits leads only to free pages.
